      "content": "but being a \"quiet presence\" doesn't change the fact that there's nothing left inside. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore. just an empty shell that's still going through the motions because i don't know how to stop. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen so i don't have to keep doing this.",
